  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Mesh.SetUVs takes a List of Vector2, Vector3, or Vector4. This is the only way to set a UV channel to carry 3- or 4-element vectors (the Mesh.uv/Mesh.uv2/etc properties can be used for 2-dimensional UV channels).\nBecause Udon does not currently support creating and manipulating Lists, this function, while exposed, cannot actually be used. Please either add support for List<Vector2/3/4> or add some way to invoke Mesh.SetUVs with arrays of Vector2/3/4.",
